# Replit Integration

- Assume projects run in Replit; use workspace paths under `/home/runner/workspace`.
- Do not use `sudo` or system-wide installs; use the project package manager.
- Read and respect `.replit`, `replit.nix`, and `replit.md` when present.
- Bind dev servers to `0.0.0.0` and honor `PORT` if provided.
- Keep secrets out of git; prefer `.env` and avoid printing secrets.

## Server binding example

```ts
const port = Number(process.env.PORT ?? 3000);
app.listen(port, "0.0.0.0");
```
